Windows Registry Editor Version 5.00

; XP's per-user theme settings, as XP's themeui.dll writes them at first
; logon (regsvr32 /i:/UserInstall) from HIVEDEF.INF's classic appearance
; schemes: the color schemes of the Windows Classic style (Brick, Desert,
; High Contrast..., each with its sizes) and the visual style that the
; Windows XP and Windows Classic themes turn on and off. Under Wine the
; conversion does not run; prefix/extras.py imports this file.

